---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy | Plumba"
  description="How this Plumba website handles information while you explore the project."
>
  <section class="legal-page container">
    <header class="legal-heading">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>A simple website for a project being built in the open.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Browsing this website</h2>
      <p>
        You can explore Plumba without creating an account. This version of the
        website has no signup form, advertising cookies, or third party
        analytics.
      </p>
      <h2>Technical requests</h2>
      <p>
        Your browser requests pages, fonts, and other files from the server that
        hosts this website. Those requests can include your IP address, browser
        information, and the page that referred you here. Any server logging
        depends on how the website is hosted.
      </p>
      <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
      <p>
        Some links take you to GitHub or another external website. Those
        services have their own privacy policies and handle information
        independently of this website.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions about the project</h2>
      <p>
        Visit the{' '}
        <a href="https://github.com/theobiabo/plumba">Plumba repository</a>
        for the current project information. Avoid sharing personal information
        in public issues or discussions.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/">
        Back to Plumba
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
